      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present Apartment 3 Grange Lodge Avenue to the Dublin 13 market.  \r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a spacious hallway leading to a bright and airy open-plan living and dining area, featuring impressive floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the space with natural light. This inviting area seamlessly connects to the kitchen, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining. There are two generously proportioned double bedrooms including a well-appointed primary bedroom with its own en-suite, along with a contemporary family bathroom.\r\n\r\nClongriffin offers a wealth of amenities, including parks, restaurants, schools, and shops. The area is well-connected by public transport, with numerous bus routes and easy access to the DART. The M50 and M1 motorways are also easily accessible, as is Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nWe highly recommend arranging a viewing at your earliest convenience.\r\n\r\n**Disclaimer:** While we have diligently ensured the accuracy of this information, some details may have been provided by the vendor. We do not assume responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies, and we advise all viewers to seek their own professional advice."
      },
